message.content:
Sure! Below is a simple example of an “interactive card” that rotates when you hover over it.  
It uses only **HTML** and **CSS** (no JavaScript).  

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Rotating Card Demo</title>
<style>
/* Basic reset */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

/* Center the card on the page */
body {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    height:100vh;
    background:#f0f0f0;
}

/* Card container – perspective gives depth */
.card-wrapper {
    width:300px;
    height:200px;
    perspective:800px;          /* Creates 3D space */
}

/* The actual card – positioned relative so we can transform it */
.card {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    position:relative;
    transition:transform .6s ease-in-out;   /* Smooth rotation */
    transform-style:preserve-3d;           /* Keep children in 3D */
    cursor:pointer;
}

/* Front side of the card */
.card__face--front,
.card__face--back {
    position:absolute;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    backface-visibility:hidden;            /* Hide backside when rotated */
    border-radius:12px;
    overflow:hidden;
    color:white;
    font-family:sans-serif;
    font-size:1.2rem;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Styling for front face */
.card__face--front {
    background:#3498db;                    /* Blue background */
}

/* Styling for back face */
.card__face--back {
    background:#e74c3c;                    /* Red background */
    transform:rotateY(180deg);             /* Start flipped */
}

/* Hover effect – flip the card */
.card:hover {
    transform:rotateY(180deg);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card-wrapper">
    <div class="card">
        <!-- Front side -->
        <div class="card__face card__face--front">
            <h2>Front Side</h2>
            <p>Hover me!</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Back side -->
        <div class="card__face card__face--back">
            <h2>Back Side</h2>
            <p>Thanks for hovering.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
```

### How it works

| Element | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `.card-wrapper` | Provides a 3‑D perspective (`perspective:800px`). |
| `.card` | Holds both faces; `transition` makes the rotation smooth. |
| `.card__face--front / .card__face--back` | Each side of the card. `backface-visibility:hidden` hides the hidden side during rotation. |
| `.card__face--back` | Initially rotated 180° so it’s hidden until the card flips. |
| `.card:hover` | Rotates the whole card 180° around the Y‑axis. |

Feel free to replace the colors, text, or add images inside each face. Enjoy your rotating card!
